{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/d7cec12c-b139-4441-99ce-c9b776e1e9c3.png?t=1741709388\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/45f86002-5c02-465d-a0e7-a0c744900290.png?t=1741709388\" />   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own cozy caf\u00e9, creating a welcoming space for townsfolk to meet and spend time with adorable critters who have joined your caf\u00e9!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/Banner_1_-_Create_cafe.gif?t=1741709388\" />  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/CC_Steam_title_banner04.png?t=1741709388\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect latte art, deliver cakes, and serve coffee as your keen customers flock to spend time with critters at your caf\u00e9. Host critter-themed parties \u2013 movie nights, birthdays, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/Banner_2_-_Serve_customers__coffee__etc_extra.gif?t=1741709388\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/CC_Steam_title_banner05.png?t=1741709388\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the magical world of the Otherlands, discover and save 35 adorable critters! Discover Mogbert, Glowli and many more of the super cute creatures waiting to meet you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/Banner_3_-_Rescue_critters.gif?t=1741709388\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/CC_Steam_title_banner06.png?t=1741709388\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Actively nurture your critters with love and care \u2013 you\u2019re able to play with them, feed them a variety of treats, wash and brush them. Critters will bond with you as they join you in your caf\u00e9 activities, developing new traits and unlocking cute new looks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/Banner_4_-_Critter_care.gif?t=1741709388\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/CC_Steam_title_banner07.png?t=1741709388\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been receiving mysterious letters informing you of magical portals appearing around Gold Leaf Isle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore several exciting locations and vibrant worlds. Traverse through portals to the Otherlands, navigate puzzles and find new critters which you will nurture and care for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/Banner_5_-_Explore.gif?t=1741709388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/CC_Steam_title_banner08.png?t=1741709388\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express yourself! Customize your character with a wide range of looks, which you can change at any time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend hours designing your caf\u00e9 in detail with tables, chairs, sofas, wallpapers, flooring, wall decorations and much more.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After rescuing your critters, customize their habitat so they will thrive in their new home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367610/extras/Banner_6_-_Customise_your_character__etc.gif?t=1741709388\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Critter-Cal mission","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2367610/6e6092ccbbd735fcef117afbe2bf33ea31865d5f.jpg"},{"name":"A few friends for the caf\u00e9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2367610/adcd74300e5128677c42dfe019140c09115404c4.jpg"},{"name":"More friends for the caf\u00e9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2367610/6487eec06effc4959d3cbc4c27f21fab5c3e7a8c.jpg"},{"name":"Expanding family","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2367610/a37149aa8a56e1975f6312579662fe7810599a67.jpg"},{"name":"One Big Happy Family","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2367610/c8b583bb017a172ce107b2314979ed0a04be5412.jpg"},{"name":"Humble Caf\u00e9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2367610/3dcd903a57c527de12fe39bc2eeb126da74871ca.jpg"},{"name":"Snug Caf\u00e9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2367610/cb46363678603c459ec380a44862790b94df17c1.jpg"},{"name":"Cheerful Caf\u00e9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2367610/6cca3b04e81c1557aa514cd32c72e9a476948ac1.jpg"},{"name":"Cosy Caf\u00e9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2367610/8b61daacc55dee9d426838dab863cbdea779902a.jpg"},{"name":"Cherished Caf\u00e9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2367610/816270fb7dd4ecc50d70a17fbd93d866cde05f62.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2367610?t=1741709388","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_